# Copy to .env (gitignored). Only read at build time by docusaurus.config.ts.
#
# Two Mapbox PUBLIC tokens (pk.…), both created in the Mapbox dashboard, neither the account's
# default token (default tokens cannot be URL-restricted):
#   - production: URL-restricted to https://dtmeadows.me — lives ONLY in the GitHub Actions
#     secret MAPBOX_TOKEN, never in a file.
#   - development: URL-restricted to http://localhost:3000 — this file, for `yarn start` / `yarn build`.
MAPBOX_TOKEN=
